<title>UK: NordLB sets $200 million December 2000 bond.</title>
<headline>NordLB sets $200 million December 2000 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Tokyo-Mitsubishi International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   NORDDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    $200 MLN	COUPON     6.0	 MATURITY    21.DEC.00</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.12    PAY DATE  S-10.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.50	REOFFER    99.82     SPREAD	+8 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS UK/US/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    =	   CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.20	SELL CONC  1.30	PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND THREE YEAR U.S. TREASURIES</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
